# Minimal on purpose. Only (1) secrets that must never be committed to this PUBLIC repository,
# (2) local tool state, and (3) files that our own tools/OS actually generate.
# NOT ignored on purpose: the deliberately tracked review artifacts under tools/tracing-poc/*-artifacts/,
# generated site files (index.html, app-details/, sitemap.xml, ...) and assets/ (mockups, icons).
# The `generate` workflow runs `git add -A` on main, so anything not ignored here and left in the tree
# is committed to Production.

# --- secrets / credentials (never commit) ---
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
.credentials.json

# --- Claude Code local state ---
.claude/worktrees/
.claude/settings.local.json

# --- output written into the repo by our test tools ---
tools/record-dashboard-poc/dashboard-realbrowser-artifacts/
*.log

# --- Python bytecode ---
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# --- OS metadata ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
